<title>UK: Libya issues snap tender to buy white sugar - trade.</title>
<headline>Libya issues snap tender to buy white sugar - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Libya tendered on Tuesday to buy 14,000 tonnes of white sugar for shipment in November/December, traders said.</p>
<p>Replies for the tender were expected on October 17, they added. The sugar required is 45 ICUMSA quality.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
